### Admin – variabili
@baseUrl    = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN
@courseId   = COURSE_UUID

# FIX: route corretta è GET /admin/users (non GET /admin)
# FIX: aggiungere Authorization su tutte le route

# ─── GET /admin/users ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Lista tutti gli utenti (nessun filtro)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lista utenti filtrati per ruolo STUDENT
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=STUDENT
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lista utenti filtrati per ruolo INSTRUCTOR
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=INSTRUCTOR
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lista utenti filtrati per stato attivo
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?is_active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lista utenti disattivi
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?is_active=false
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lista utenti con entrambi i filtri
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?role=INSTRUCTOR&is_active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ─── PATCH /admin/courses/:id/approve ────────────────────────────────

### Approva un corso in PENDING
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/courses/{{courseId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approva un corso già PUBLISHED (atteso 403)
# Prima cambia courseId con UUID di un corso PUBLISHED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/courses/{{courseId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ─── PATCH /admin/courses/:id/reject ─────────────────────────────────

### Rifiuta un corso in PENDING
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/courses/{{courseId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Rifiuta un corso in DRAFT (atteso 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/courses/{{courseId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ─── GET /admin/stats ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Statistiche globali
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
